 pour zoomer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1UfeikxIQ3cQ7kNvwHoD4yc&_nc_oc=AdqiBQrv2YjlXd9eNPXx3LmWhK1tfgzHUr_sd81G4cczOfs2itT_q1ZWZRdzIXteo98&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_hEGbD1FGYOJ4Qblb_w9hjQyhrmvwuWkn6Kh8PRyqbKw&oe=6A395334"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SX0v0y5KisUQ7kNvwFANCPX&_nc_oc=AdoJBd2RyBq5WZRTfO8tw4JBhQju58ndTICjF6aE7UmkgvA-eIiPH6G16VbTc3DyhWQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_RV61HSLxC48dgR_IDizWu9w3h2UKZrW88WcGsrd6cXA&oe=6A395496"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HytJ8KXKF3kQ7kNvwFk5WjI&_nc_oc=AdorZT78Ff502RVtdwPmNTDHnXU7KD4FTK4lzj9DvGc2gTyhQm0RSCTk1Ye_Mjds1DI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-K3sRl6hLThsEnGp7KbQ2Sj1X1-XF7Hhep6c-oIutbRg&oe=6A393177"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "